# (AI-assisted) every checkpoint in game order with all tasks closed and 100 power cells (the
# late-game world: lifted boulder, built bridges, open gates...). Jak walks, jumps and attacks
# at each one; the dwell lets a death finish before the next continue.
# Read: grep -a 'pad script' (CP lines, Jak's state at +240/+540/+880 frames), '[ctr] loaded',
# 'failed to load', NaN warnings. About 25 min on the host.
#   OPENGOAL_NO_SOUND=1 OPENGOAL_PAD_SCRIPT=<this file> build-host-small/game/gk --proj-path <proj>
#     --config-path <scratch dir> --ctr-gfx -- -boot -fakeiso -nosound -cbackend
# (host small-memory C-mode gk running the p3ds modules; --config-path keeps the saves out of
# the user's OpenGOAL folder). Format and commands: game/sce/pad_script.h
0 wait *target* target-title-wait
150 tasks 2 111
